@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam objectAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #F6F8FA
skinparam objectBorderColor #59636E

title Published history after twelve successful changes
object "<u>history:AddressBookHistory</u>" as history {
  position = 10
  states = [s2, s3, ..., s12]
  descriptions = [action3, action4, ..., action12]
}
object "<u>s2:AddressBook</u>" as oldest {
  records after change 2
}
object "<u>s12:AddressBook</u>" as latest #DDF4FF {
  records after change 12
}
history --> oldest : states[0]
history --> latest : states[10]
oldest -[hidden]right-> latest
note bottom of oldest
  s0, s1 and their actions are no longer retained.
  Ten undos reach s2 at position 0.
  A further undo is unavailable.
end note
note bottom of latest
  Nine intermediate snapshots are omitted here.
  From s2, ten redos restore s12.
  A failed save never evicts live history.
end note
@enduml
